        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O na Yonathani, mwendw’a‐ĩthe wa Ndaviti, aĩ mũtai, mũndũ wĩ ũmanyi, na mũandĩki: Yeiieli mwana wa Akimoni aĩ vamwe na ana ma mũsumbĩ: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Aithoveli aĩ mũtai wa mũsumbĩ: na Usiai Mũaliiki aĩ mũnyanyae wa mũsumbĩ: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
